---
import { site } from "../../config/site";
---

<section id="help" class="py-16 md:py-24">
  <div class="fade-in-section mx-auto max-w-[1100px] px-4 sm:px-6">
    <h2
      class="max-w-3xl font-serif text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-4xl"
    >
      I'm not a coach, a course, or a deal finder. I'm a broker who works deals
      every day.
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-prose text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      Most people selling buyer help have never sat on the other side of the
      table. I sit there every day. I know what brokers think, what sellers
      take seriously, what lenders approve, and what kills deals in week six.
    </p>

    <div
      class="mt-10 grid gap-8 border-y border-line py-10 sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-10"
    >
      {
        site.proof.stats.map((stat) => (
          <div>
            <p class="font-serif text-4xl font-semibold text-ink">
              {stat.value}
            </p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              {stat.text}
            </p>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <h3 class="mt-12 font-serif text-xl font-semibold">What I don't do</h3>
    <ul class="mt-5 flex max-w-prose flex-col gap-3 text-ink-soft">
      <li>
        I don't find deals. Thousands are listed publicly. I help you spot the
        good ones and get to the front of the line.
      </li>
      <li>
        I don't run diligence. I build your team and tell you what to ask them.
      </li>
      <li>I don't take a commission. Ever.</li>
      <li>
        I don't give legal, tax, or investment advice. I tell you when you
        need it.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
